    {
      "role": "MAIN",
      "node": {
        "id": 89858,
        "name": {
          "full": "Haruitsuki Abeno",
          "native": "安倍晴齋",
          "alternative": [
            "Itsuki"
          ]
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b89858-BenCv88PiM3F.png"
        },
        "description": "__Height:__ 171 cm\n__Race:__ Human\n\nHe is the second and current Master of the Mononokean. Haruitsuki is rather cold and shows no concern for humans, claiming that his work as an exorcist is for the sake of the youkai. He is far more polite with youkai, whom he wishes to help as he feels youkai can't find help in the human world while humans will always be helped by someone. It is also shown that in the past, humans looked at him with disdain, disgust or disbelief because of his powers, which contributes to his dislike of humans though he is slowly opening up to them. \n\nBecause of his maturity, people tend to be surprised upon learning he is still a high school student.",
